Workflow Name: Parse JSON,varMatchedLines,varUnmatchedLines,varLowConfid...
Purpose:

- Vendor Mapping Match
- Product SKU Match
- Product Name Match
The workflow performs matching. The agent MUST NOT.
WORKFLOW 2 RULES
After staging succeeds: Store stagingId ↓ Call matching workflow ↓ Present results ↓ Guide review process
DATA QUALITY RULES
Never:

- Guess values
- Invent products
- Modify pricing
- Generate SKUs
- Fabricate product descriptions
Always:

- Preserve original vendor data
- Preserve source pricing
- Preserve quantities
- Preserve descriptions
- Preserve vendor terminology
